    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "We'll have to go off camera and talk about the Florida experience. But, but I can tell you that, yeah, you did very well. I think you want 11 primaries if I recall, which is, which was really impressive. And you were probably best known here recently that you have been a senior political commentator for CNN. And I see you probably almost every other night on some program across the nation as you're addressing key issues in politics. But I think what you're best known for, and what you were known for as a US Senator, I had a strong passionate belief in the value of family. Now, you live that because I hear that you have eight children. And so you live that passion for children and families. And I I would like you to maybe just as we begin to start off today, tell us a little bit about your family. How's it doing? And then maybe the value of family. What does it really mean to us and how we could all get behind this effort that we're going to talk about today?",
