    "episode_id": 47420,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/7/47420.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "And we're going to do that because it's part of nurturing well-being. It's part of the whole picture of what we do. We don't want to have to wait for children to come into crisis before we start having to address these issues. And, you know, the federal government just passed the Family First Prevention Services Act, FFPSA. It's transforming our world. And really one of the things they wanted to do is get upstream.",
